圖\">＝6－1－1＝4<br>梯形  ABCD  面積＝<img src=\"img/7c6402_y93-2_r105.svg\" width=\"16\" alt=\"附圖\">（<img src=\"img/7c6402_y93-2_r106.svg\" width=\"28\" alt=\"附圖\">＋<img src=\"img/7c6402_y93-2_r107.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">）×  <img src=\"img/7c6402_y93-2_r108.svg\" width=\"28\" alt=\"附圖\"><br>＝<img src=\"img/7c6402_y93-2_r109.svg\" width=\"16\" alt=\"附圖\">（4＋6）×<img src=\"img/7c6402_y93-2_r110.svg\" width=\"24\" alt=\"附圖\">＝5<img src=\"img/7c6402_y93-2_r111.svg\" width=\"24\" alt=\"附圖\"><br><img src=\"img/7c6402_y93-2_image15.png\" class=\"blk\" width=\"167\" alt=\"附圖\">","k":["93年第二次基測"],"d":"中","html":1},{"id":"05800232","s":"如圖(一)，四邊形  ABCD、EFGH  均是長為  2x、寬為  3  的矩形。今將兩個矩形做部分疊合，使得  E  點在<img src=\"img/7c6402_y93-2_r113.svg\" width=\"28\" alt=\"附圖\">上，B  點在<img src=\"img/7c6402_y93-2_r114.svg\" width=\"25\" alt=\"附圖\">上，如圖(二)所示。若連接<img src=\"img/7c6402_y93-2_r115.svg\" width=\"28\" alt=\"附圖\">，則五邊形  AGHCD  的面積為何？【93  年第  2  次基測】<br><img src=\"img/7c6402_y93-2_image16.png\" class=\"blk\" width=\"229\" alt=\"附圖\">","o":["4x<sup>2</sup>－<img src=\"img/7c6402_y93-2_r117.svg\" width=\"16\" alt=\"附圖\">","4x<sup>2</sup>＋<img src=\"img/7c6402_y93-2_r118.svg\" width=\"16\" alt=\"附圖\">","2x<sup>2</sup>＋6x－<img src=\"img/7c6402_y93-2_r119.svg\" width=\"16\" alt=\"附圖\">","2x<sup>2</sup>＋6x＋<img src=\"img/7c6402_y93-2_r120.svg\" width=\"16\" alt=\"附圖\">"],"a":2,"e":"<img src=\"img/7c6402_y93-2_r121.svg\" width=\"21\" alt=\"附圖\">＝<img src=\"img/7c6402_y93-2_r122.svg\" width=\"21\" alt=\"附圖\">＝2x－3<br>所求＝（2x）<sup>2</sup>－<img src=\"img/7c6402_y93-2_r123.svg\" width=\"64\" alt=\"附圖\"><br>＝4x<sup>2</sup>－<img src=\"img/7c6402_y93-2_r124.svg\" width=\"88\" alt=\"附圖\"><br>＝2x<sup>2</sup>＋6x－<img src=\"img/7c6402_y93-2_r125.svg\" width=\"16\" alt=\"附圖\"><br><img src=\"img/7c6402_y93-2_image17.png\" width=\"94\" alt=\"附圖\">","k":["93年第二次基測"],"d":"中","html":1},{"id":"05800233","s":"如圖(一)，<img src=\"img/7c6402_y93-2_r127.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">為一個不等臂的蹺蹺板，O  為支點，距離地面  30  公分，A  點在地面上，且<img src=\"img/7c6402_y93-2_r128.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">：<img src=\"img/7c6402_y93-2_r129.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">＝2：1。今守守與不化蟲分別坐在  A、B  兩端，使得蹺蹺板成水平狀態，如圖(二)所示。則兩圖中  B  點與地面的高度相差多少公分？【93  年第  2  次基測】<br><img src=\"img/7c6402_y93-2_image18.png\" width=\"153\" alt=\"附圖\"><br>圖(一)<br><img src=\"img/7c6402_y93-2_image19.png\" width=\"151\" alt=\"附圖\"><br>圖(二)","o":["10","15","25","30"],"a":1,"e":"設相差  x  公分<br>∵<img src=\"img/7c6402_y93-2_r132.svg\" width=\"24\" alt=\"附圖\">＝<img src=\"img/7c6402_y93-2_r133.svg\" width=\"16\" alt=\"附圖\"><br>∴x＝15<br><img src=\"img/7c6402_y93-2_image20.png\" width=\"101\" alt=\"附圖\">","k":["93年第二次基測"],"d":"中","html":1},{"id":"05800234","s":"如圖，有一半徑為  2  公分的圓形時鐘圖片，其中每個刻度間的弧長均相等。若小明依鐘面  11  時和  1  時的位置，畫一直線，則灰色區域面積是多少平方公分？【93  年第  2  次基測】<br><img src=\"img/7c6402_y93-2_image21.png\" width=\"147\" alt=\"附圖\">","o":["4－<img src=\"img/7c6402_y93-2_r136.svg\" width=\"31\" alt=\"附圖\">","<img src=\"img/7c6402_y93-2_r137.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">－<img src=\"img/7c6402_y93-2_r138.svg\" width=\"24\" alt=\"附圖\">","<img src=\"img/7c6402_y93-2_r139.svg\" width=\"33\" alt=\"附圖\">－2","<img src=\"img/7c6402_y93-2_r140.svg\" width=\"13\" alt=\"附圖\">－2"],"a":1,"e":"360°÷  12  ×  2＝60°<br>∴∠AOB＝60°　∵<img src=\"img/7c6402_y93-2_r141.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">＝<img src=\"img/7c6402_y93-2_r142.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\"><br>∴△AOB  為正三角形<br>扇形  AOB  面積＝<img src=\"img/7c6402_y93-2_r143.svg\" width=\"36\" alt=\"附圖\">×π×  2<sup>2</sup>＝<img src=\"img/7c6402_y93-2_r144.svg\" width=\"16\" alt=\"附圖\">π＝<img src=\"img/7c6402_y93-2_r145.svg\" width=\"16\" alt=\"附圖\">π（平方公分）<br>△AOB  面積＝<img src=\"img/7c6402_y93-2_r146.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">×  2<sup>2</sup>＝<img src=\"img/7c6402_y93-2_r147.svg\" width=\"24\" alt=\"附圖\">（平方公分）<br>灰色面積＝扇形  AOB  面積－△AOB  面積<br>＝<img src=\"img/7c6402_y93-2_r148.svg\" width=\"16\" alt=\"附圖\">π－<img src=\"img/7c6402_y93-2_r149.svg\" width=\"24\" alt=\"附圖\">（平方公分）<br><img src=\"img/7c6402_y93-2_image22.png\" width=\"61\" alt=\"附圖\">","k":["93年第二次基測"],"d":"易","html":1},{"id":"05800235","s":"下列哪一個二次函數，其圖形和 y＝4x<sup>2</sup>－8x 的圖形有相同的頂點？【93  年第  2  次基測】","o":["y＝2x<sup>2</sup>－4x","y＝－2（x＋1）<sup>2</sup>","y＝2（x＋1）<sup>2</sup>＋4","y＝－2（x－1）<sup>2</sup>－4"],"a":3,"e":"y＝4x<sup>2</sup>－8x＝4（x<sup>2</sup>－2x＋1）－4＝4（x－1）<sup>2</sup>－4  <br><img src=\"img/7c6402_y93-2_r151.svg\" width=\"20\" alt=\"附圖\">頂點（1，－4）<br>(Ａ)y＝2x<sup>2</sup>－4x＝2（x<sup>2</sup>－2x＋1）－2<br>＝2（x－1）<sup>2</sup>－2  <img src=\"img/7c6402_y93-2_r152.svg\" width=\"20\" alt=\"附圖\">  頂點（1，－2）<br>(Ｂ)y＝－2（x＋1）<sup>2</sup>  <img src=\"img/7c6402_y93-2_r153.svg\" width=\"20\" alt=\"附圖\">  頂點（－1，0）<br>(Ｃ)y＝2（x＋1）<sup>2</sup>＋4  <img src=\"img/7c6402_y93-2_r154.svg\" width=\"20\" alt=\"附圖\">  頂點（－1，4）<br>(Ｄ)y＝－2（x－1）<sup>2</sup>－4  <img src=\"img/7c6402_y93-2_r155.svg\" width=\"20\" alt=\"附圖\">  頂點（1，－4）","k":["93年第二次基測"],"d":"中","html":1},{"id":"05800236","s":"利用配方法將  4x<sup>2</sup>＋8x＋a  化成  b（x＋c）<sup>2</sup>＋3  的形式，則  a＋b＋c＝？【93  年第  2  次基測】","o":["9","12","13","25"],"a":1,"e":"4x<sup>2</sup>＋8x＋a＝4（x<sup>2</sup>＋2x）＋a<br>＝4（x<sup>2</sup>＋2x＋1）＋a－4<br>＝4（x＋1）<sup>2</sup>＋a－4<br>對照  b（x＋c）<sup>2</sup>＋3<br>∴b＝4，c＝1，a－4＝3，a＝7<br>∴a＋b＋c＝7＋4＋1＝12","k":["93年第二次基測"],"d":"中","html":1},{"id":"05800237","s":"如圖，梯形  ABCD  中，<img src=\"img/7c6402_y93-2_r156.svg\" width=\"28\" alt=\"附圖\">  //  <img src=\"img/7c6402_y93-2_r157.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">，<img src=\"img/7c6402_y93-2_r158.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">⊥<img src=\"img/7c6402_y93-2_r159.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">，其中<img src=\"img/7c6402_y93-2_r160.svg\" width=\"28\" alt=\"附圖\">＝1、<img src=\"img/7c6402_y93-2_r161.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">＝4、<img src=\"img/7c6402_y93-2_r162.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">＝8。今自  B  點剪出<img src=\"img/7c6402_y93-2_r163.svg\" width=\"28\" alt=\"附圖\">，使得<img src=\"img/7c6402_y93-2_r164.svg\" width=\"28\" alt=\"附圖\">將梯形分成兩塊面積相等的圖形，若  N  在<img src=\"img/7c6402_y93-2_r165.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">上，則<img src=\"img/7c6402_y93-2_r166.svg\" width=\"28\" alt=\"附圖\">＝？【93  年第  2  次基測】<br><img src=\"img/7c6402_y93-2_image23.png\" width=\"95\" alt=\"附圖\">","o":["1","3","4","5"],"a":1,"e":"設<img src=\"img/7c6402_y93-2_r168.svg\" width=\"28\" alt=\"附圖\">＝x　∵<img src=\"img/7c6402_y93-2_r169.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">＝8　∴<img src=\"img/7c6402_y93-2_r170.svg\" width=\"28\" alt=\"附圖\">＝8－x<br>梯形  ABCD  面積＝<img src=\"img/7c6402_y93-2_r171.svg\" width=\"16\" alt=\"附圖\">（4＋1）×  8＝20<br>∵△BCN  面積＝<img src=\"img/7c6402_y93-2_r172.svg\" width=\"16\" alt=\"附圖\">梯形  ABCD  面積＝10<br>∴<img src=\"img/7c6402_y93-2_r173.svg\" width=\"16\" alt=\"附圖\">  ×  4  ×（8－x）＝10<br>16－2x＝10　∴x＝3，<img src=\"img/7c6402_y93-2_r174.svg\" width=\"28\" alt=\"附圖\">＝3<br><img src=\"img/7c6402_y93-2_image24.png\" width=\"79\" alt=\"附圖\">","k":["93年第二次基測"],"d":"中","html":1},{"id":"05800238","s":"附圖是某電信公司的通話費計算方式：300  秒以內只繳基本費，超過  300  秒之後的費用，與通話時間成線型函數關係。則基本費是多少元？【93  年第  2  次基測】<br><img src=\"img/7c6402_y93-2_image25.png\" class=\"blk\" width=\"227\" alt=\"附圖\">","o":["26","28","30","32"],"a":3,"e":"設  y＝ax＋b，通過（500，36）、（1200，50）  <br><img src=\"img/7c6402_y93-2_r177.svg\" width=\"20\" alt=\"附圖\">  <img src=\"img/7c6402_y93-2_r178.svg\" class=\"blk\" width=\"210\" alt=\"附圖\"><br>由②－①  得  700a＝14  <img src=\"img/7c6402_y93-2_r179.svg\" width=\"20\" alt=\"附圖\">  a＝<img src=\"img/7c6402_y93-2_r180.svg\" width=\"29\" alt=\"附圖\">＝<img src=\"img/7c6402_y93-2_r181.svg\" width=\"23\" alt=\"附圖\">  代入①  得  36＝10＋b  <img src=\"img/7c6402_y93-2_r182.svg\" width=\"20\" alt=\"附圖\">  b＝26<br>∴y＝<img src=\"img/7c6402_y93-2_r183.svg\" width=\"23\" alt=\"附圖\">x＋26，當  x＝300，y＝<img src=\"img/7c6402_y93-2_r184.svg\" width=\"23\" alt=\"附圖\">×  300＋26＝32","k":["93年第二次基測"],"d":"中","html":1},{"id":"05800239","s":"在附圖的方格中，填入適當的數字，使得每行、每列以及對角線上的數字和是相同的，則★的值為何？【93  年第  2  次基測】<br><table class=\"qt\"><tr><td>16</td><td></td><td>14</td></tr><tr><td>★</td><td></td><td>15</td></tr><tr><td>12</td><td></td><td></td></tr></table>","o":["9","10","11","13"],"a":2,"e":